.DS_Store
.env
.env.*

# 原始 Pages 文件不進入公開 Git 歷史
*.pages

# Inbox 與原始來源預設只追蹤說明檔
inbox/*
!inbox/README.md
sources/original/*
!sources/original/README.md

# 來源授權未確認前，轉出的正文與衍生索引只留本機
knowledge/cards/**/*.md
!knowledge/cards/**/README.md
knowledge/combinations/major-arcana/
knowledge/foundations/*-source.md
catalog/card-index.json
catalog/coverage.json
qa/import-report.json
qa/expected-current.yaml

# 私人牌例與個人學習紀錄
readings/private/
notes/private/
